/target
ci/bins/

# Documents and presentations never belong in this repository: it mirrors to
# a public GitHub repo and to crates.io, and the scrub check cannot read
# inside a binary file to tell whether it carries anything internal. Keep
# slides, spreadsheets and exported reports outside the working tree, or add
# an explicit exception here after deciding the file is publishable.
*.ppt
*.pptx
*.key
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.doc
*.docx
*.pdf
*.odp
*.ods
*.odt

# The slide generator falls in the same bucket: it is a build script for a
# customer-facing deck, carries measured numbers inline, and has no role in
# building or using the crate.
relyt-ingest-deck-gen.py
